# 6. Naming Consistency (Important)

For cross-platform adoption:

Use **token names**, not editor-specific names:

```
helsing.bg
helsing.fg
helsing.comment
helsing.keyword
helsing.string
helsing.function
helsing.type
helsing.error
```

This lets you port easily to:

* VS Code
* WezTerm
* Alacritty
* Waybar
* CSS variables

